* 12V -> 3.3V Buck — TPS54360 reference
Vin Vin 0 12
L1 Vin SW 4.7u
Cout SW 0 22u
* Simplified buck behavioral model for sim
Vsw SW 0 PULSE(0 12 0 20n 20n 0.5u 1.72u) ; 580kHz, D=0.275
Rload 3V3 0 2.2  ; 1.5A
Lout SW 3V3 4.7u
Cout2 3V3 0 44u
.tran 0 2m 1m 10n
.meas TRAN Vout AVG V(3V3) FROM 1m TO 2m
.meas TRAN ripple PP V(3V3) FROM 1.5m TO 2m
.end
